mn_DdVRVL":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"First mandoline I've trusted in years","text":"<p>I have a scar on my thumb from my old mandoline. Threw it out two years ago and went back to a knife. This is the first one I've trusted since. My hands never go anywhere near the blade.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Sarah K.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_G3cLU4":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Meal prep Sunday just got a lot shorter","text":"<p>Meal prep used to take me 45 minutes of chopping. Now it's maybe 10. Cucumbers, carrots, zucchini — all done before the rice cooker even finishes. This thing actually saves me time, not just in theory.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>David R.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_iTNTxq":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"I was so wrong about kitchen gadgets","text":"<p>I almost didn't buy this because I have a drawer full of kitchen gadgets I never use. This is the only one that's still on my counter three weeks later. It's genuinely faster than a knife and I don't have to psych myself up to use it.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Lauren M.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Neither hand is anywhere near the blade","text":"<p>I threw out my old mandoline after a close call. This one is completely different—your hands stay on top the whole time. I actually use it now instead of avoiding it.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Jessica T.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Great slaws in 3 minutes","text":"<p>I used to dread making coleslaw because of all the chopping. Now it's done before I even preheat the oven. Total game changer for meal prep.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Mike R.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3":{"type":"co